      161.85,
      202.97,
      401.73,
      238.31
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE WELFARE SOCIETY OF THE SCHOOL FOR THEMENTALLY SUBNORMAL CHILD (INCORPORATION) ACT, NO. 75 OF1988",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      250.97,
      401.91,
      274.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      286.97,
      401.89,
      322.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Welfare Society of theSchool for the Mentally Subnormal Child (Incorporation)(Amendment) Act, No. of 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      334.97,
      401.92,
      382.31
    ],
    "text": "2.The long title to the Welfare Society of the School forthe Mentally Subnormal Child (Incorporation) Act(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyrepealed and the following long title substituted thereof:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      394.97,
      401.87,
      418.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201cAn ordinance to Incorporate the Chitra Lane WelfareSociety for Children with Special Needs\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      430.97,
      401.89,
      490.31
    ],
    "text": "3.(1) In the principal enactment and in any other writtenlaw there shall be substituted for the words \u201cthe WelfareSociety of the School for the Mentally Subnormal Child(Incorporation) Act\u201d of the words \u201cthe Chitra Lane WelfareSociety for Children with Special Needs Ordinance\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      499.01,
      401.91,
      582.35
    ],
    "text": "(2) Every reference to \u201cthe Chitra Lane Welfare Society ofthe School for the Mentally Subnormal Child (Incorporation)Act\u201d in any regulation, rule, notice, notification, contract,communication, deed, legal document or other documentshall be read and construed as a reference respectively to the\u201cChitra Lane Welfare Society for Children with SpecialNeeds\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      593.93,
      401.87,
      619.28
    ],
    "text": "4. Clause 6(3) of the principal enactment is to beamended as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      632.93,
      401.88,
      668.87
    ],
    "text": "\u201cA vacancy in the Board of Trustees of the Corporationoccurring upon the death, resignation, incapacity orremoval of a Trustee from office, his/her successor",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
